  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.22 Life Insurance Companies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.22 Life Insurance Companies. For the purpose of a motor vehicle record being requested pursuant to RSA 260:14, V(a)(10), a life insurance company authorized to write life insurance policies in New Hampshire, or its authorized agent, shall not obtain or use a motor vehicle record for use in connection with a claims investigation activity, anti-fraud activity, rating or underwriting that is not related to a life insurance policy.\n\nSource. #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
}
